[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0000","text":"舞蹈讲师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0010","text":"向上，向上……再向上──────\n──────不对"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0020","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0001","text":"舞蹈讲师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0030","text":"这变成编舞了，七草小姐\n我什么都没编排。只是希望你『向上攀升』，明白吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0002","text":"舞蹈讲师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0040","text":"那，再试一次好吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0050","text":"好……！\n────…………唔"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0060","text":"……──────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0003","text":"舞蹈讲师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0070","text":"嗯——那只是在摆动手掌而已哦\n没必要拘泥于鸟的意象────绯田"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0080","text":"……好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0004","text":"舞蹈讲师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0090","text":"你来试试\n向上向上……不断攀升的意象"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0100","text":"嗯————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0110","text":"──────…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0005","text":"舞蹈讲师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0120","text":"……对……\n对，很好……在那里猛然展开──────！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0121","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0130","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0140","text":"…………好厉害"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0006","text":"舞蹈讲师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0150","text":"我觉得很好。柔韧而有力\n因为身体练得很好，所以动作有很好的延展性"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0160","text":"……我可以继续跳吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0007","text":"舞蹈讲师"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0170","text":"当然。七草小姐也要好好看着\n横向移动也能表现出上升的力量感"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0180","text":"好、好的……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0190","text":"────────……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_07020000_02_0200","text":"……\n基础不一样"}]
